---
import BaseLayout from '@shared/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'About ConvertKDP';
const description = 'ConvertKDP builds fast converters for time zones, units, and temperature. No signup. Inputs stay in your browser.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} pathname="/about/" schemaType="WebPage">
  <article class="prose-like max-w-3xl space-y-4">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">About ConvertKDP</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Free, instant format converters.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">What this is</h2>
    <p>ConvertKDP (convert.kdp.cool) is the format-converter family in the <a href="https://kdp.cool/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Kdp.Cool</a> tool portal. Each converter is a single-purpose, browser-side tool: type your input, see the result instantly, and share a link if you want — nothing is sent to a server.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">The lineup</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
      <li><strong>Time Zone Converter</strong> — Convert any date and time between 80+ IANA time zones. Daylight-saving is handled by the browser's <code>Intl.DateTimeFormat</code> API.</li>
      <li><strong>Unit Converter</strong> — Length, weight, volume, and area conversions between metric and imperial units.</li>
      <li><strong>Temperature Converter</strong> — Celsius, Fahrenheit, and Kelvin, with the formula shown on the page.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Why it exists</h2>
    <p>Most online converters are bloated with autoplay videos, popups, and email-walls for "premium" features that should be free. We built ConvertKDP because we wanted the opposite: instant results, transparent math, no signup.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">How we keep it free</h2>
    <p>This is an independently maintained tool in the kedoupi (codepi) personal digital space. It does not load advertising scripts or display ads.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Our methodology</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
      <li><strong>Source data</strong>: Where applicable, we cite the authoritative source (e.g., the IANA time zone database for time zones).</li>
      <li><strong>Math</strong>: Every converter shows its formula in a "Show the math" section, so you can verify or learn. No black boxes.</li>
      <li><strong>Corrections</strong>: Found a wrong figure? Email <a href="mailto:hello@kdp.cool" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">hello@kdp.cool</a> with the page URL and the numbers you expected.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">What's next</h2>
    <p>Suggestions are welcome — see Contact.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Contact</h2>
    <p>See <a href="/contact/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Contact</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
